# Anna's synth duck, lost in the sewers (A1). Talking to it puts it in your pack and takes the actor off the map.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (The duck tilts its head. A servo whirs. It is standing in something you would rather not name.)
+ Quack.
#
o_text: Come on. Anna's waiting.
o_id: duck_come
o_goto: Taken
#
o_text: Stay here, bird.
o_id: duck_leave
o_goto: Left

name: Taken
npc: (It lets you pick it up. It weighs more than it should.)
effect: PlayerAddItem('synth_duck_item')
effect: SetFlag('duck_taken')
effect: RemoveActor('synth_duck')
effect: EndConversation

name: Left
npc: Quack.
effect: EndConversation
